# CODEOWNERS — FiscoCheck AI
#
# Define quem revisa cada parte do código. PRs que tocam estes
# arquivos exigem revisão dos owners listados (configurar branch
# protection no GitHub para reforçar).
#
# AJUSTAR: substituir @owner-* pelos handles reais quando os
# responsáveis estiverem definidos.

# Default — qualquer arquivo
*                                   @owner-tech-lead

# Frontend
apps/web/**                         @owner-frontend
packages/biome-config/**            @owner-frontend
packages/tsconfig/**                @owner-frontend
packages/shared-types/**            @owner-frontend @owner-backend

# Backend / agentes / ETL / ML
apps/api/**                         @owner-backend
apps/api/src/fiscocheck_api/agents/** @owner-backend @owner-ai
apps/api/src/fiscocheck_api/modules/ai/** @owner-ai

# Compliance / segurança — REQUER security-auditor
apps/api/src/fiscocheck_api/modules/compliance/** @owner-security @owner-backend
docs/compliance/**                  @owner-security
SECURITY.md                         @owner-security
LICENSE                             @owner-legal @owner-tech-lead

# Infra / CI
infra/**                            @owner-devops
.github/workflows/**                @owner-devops
.replit                             @owner-devops
replit.nix                          @owner-devops

# Documentação / ADRs
docs/adr/**                         @owner-tech-lead @owner-architect
docs/architecture/**                @owner-tech-lead @owner-architect
docs/design-system/**               @owner-design @owner-frontend
docs/modules/**                     @owner-tech-lead

# Skills (Claude Code)
.claude/skills/**                   @owner-tech-lead
